      "title": "Depth without a ladder: a protocol for describing where work acts",
      "author": "Charitology editorial project (AI-assisted draft)",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "summary": "A reproducible proposal for classifying activities across relief, repair, prevention, structure and source without turning description into a rating.",
      "volume": 0,
      "issue": 2,
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Humanity's Checklist",
          "url": "https://humanityschecklist.org/",
